XCP VGND BD UP_N VCTRL VC BU UP DOWN_N DOWN RESET VPWR VPWR VGND cp2



XPD  REFCLK LOCALCLK UP UP_N VPWR DOWN DOWN_N VGND pd3

XDL VCTRL VO_N_0 VO_N_1 VO_N_2 VO_N_3 VO_N_4 Y  VGND VPWR  BP BN line4

XBUF Y VGND VGND VPWR VPWR LOCALCLK sky130_fd_sc_hs__clkbuf_4

